      "message": "Ah, sorry, I was misremembering the path.\n\nI meant /data/misc/apexdata/com.android.virt (which does already exist - apexd creates it).\n\n/data/misc/apexdata is supposed to be for APEXes to store their data - we used /data/misc/virtualizationservice because we didn\u0027t realize that, and then it was too late to change: b/200912937. But we can leave the existing files where they are and use it for new things.\n\nWe will probably want to change the sepolicy for it though - by default it is labeled apex_module_data_file which isn\u0027t that helpful. apex_compos_data_file is an example where we did that.",
